e place rain or shine, but double-check that the hike will take place approximately an hour before the event start time to confirm that extreme weather isn't forcing the cancellation of the event. You must be on the going list in order to attend. If you aren't on the going list, please do not attend.\n\nThe distance is undetermined at this point, but in the neighbourhood of 9.5 km. The speed will be about 5 km/hr.\n\nThis is a sunrise rise, so we'll have a long pause at the top of Beare Hill at 7:15 to watch the sunrise.\n\nBring water and wear appropriate clothing and shoes to hike in. If applying anything scented to your person please do so away from the group in minimal amounts, as there are some that are allergic to strong scents (colognes , bug\nsprays,...).\n\nRequired reading for you and your guests before RSVP'ing to all events:\n\n1. [Liability Waiver and Group Rules](https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vR0LFNJVYn5j1AYl8eR63HjAxKMkRwg5ifKXqL3rP6Xl7v_Wcsx4xR_kNFluE3eILpSmP-EJ0OouQvT/pub) (updated 05/30/22)\n2. When asked at RSVP time, indicate **\\*Yes\\*** if you agree to the question provided.\n3. See general information about [Tick Safety](https://www.ontario.ca/page/lyme-disease)","startDate":"2026-10-04T10:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Twyn Rivers Parking Lot","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"on","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"55 Twyn Rivers Drive, Toronto, on"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Short Fast Hikes - Scarborough, Pickering, Ajax, Oshawa","url":"https://www.meetup.com/short-fast-hikes-scarborough-pickering-ajax/"},"performer":"Short Fast Hikes - Scarborough, Pickering, Ajax, Oshawa"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Sunday Morning Soccer","url":"https://www.meetup.com/sunday-morning-soccer-meetup/events/316551685/","description":"Sunday Morning Pick-Up Soccer - 7:30am to 9:00am\n\nMarkham Soccer Dome\n5300 14th Ave, Markham (McCowan and 14th)\n\nIndoor Turf Field.\nGame Play: 7 v 7\n\nFee: $15\nPlease EMT to miguel.jamal@gmail.com\n\nALL AGES AND SKILL LEVELS WELCOME!!!\n\nDownload the APP - Canadian Soccer Club OR\nPlease go to www.canadiansoccerclub.com\n\nThe App can be downloaded via Google Play or Apple Store.\nClick Register and create a profile.\nLog in using your credentials and select day you would like to play\nPlease RSVP on Field 1.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*ALL PLAYERS MUST RSVP ON Canadian Soccer Club APP TO PLAY\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nGames will begin at 10:00pm sharp. Players are requested to arrive by 9:50pm to pick teams and kick-off at 10:00pm sharp\nPlayers are responsible to bring the following:\n\n* Cleats or Turf Shoes\n* A white jersey and a black/dark jersey\n* Shin Guards (Strongly Recommended)\n\nIf you have any questions, please contact the organizers at admin@canadiansoccerclub.com\nThank you and look forward to seeing you guys out there.","startDate":"2026-10-04T11:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-3-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"5300 14th Ave","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Markham","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"5300 14th Ave, Markham, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Sunday Morning Men's Pickup Soccer","url":"https://www.meetup.com/sunday-morning-soccer-meetup/"},"performer":"Sunday Morning Men's Pickup Soccer"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Mississauga: Outdoor Friendly Soccer","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-soccer-meetup/events/316551944/","description":"Welcome everyone! Friendly Pick up game of soccer! All levels and genders are welcome. Please bring a white and colored shirt. Free parking available as well.\n\nThis event is free to attend. Arguments or fighting will not be tolerated and you will be asked to leave if you initiate any. Please RSVP and make sure you are on the \"going\" list in order to attend.","startDate":"2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Hawthorne Valley Park","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Mississauga","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"159 Ceremonial Dr, Mississauga, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-soccer-meetup/"},"performer":"Toronto Soccer Meetup"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Feather Birdies🏸 Sunday Morning Badminton Meetup!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-gta-badminton-meetup/events/316638292/","description":"-**$10** per person (please bring one brand new standard feather birdie)\n-OR **$13** per person (Tiger to provide one brand new standard feather birdie)\n-Plastic birdies can still be provided after the feather birdies are used up.\n\n**Attention !!! please let us know at least 48 hours (Friday@3PM) in advance if you or your guest can’t make it. This gives those on the waitlist a chance to join! Please note that \"no-shows\" or late cancellations are tracked; even a single occurrence may result in removal from the group to ensure active participation. Thanks for your cooperation!**","startDate":"2026-10-04T13:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Tiger badminton","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Markham","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"CA","streetAddress":"7755 warden ave, Unit 7, Markham, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto-GTA Badminton Meetup","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-gta-badminton-meetup/"},"performer":"Toronto-GTA Badminton Meetup"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Bus Hike: Limehouse (Bruce Trail Day)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bruce-trail-club/events/316303973/","description":"oin us to celebrate Bruce Trail Day on the trail around Limehouse. For the first 5 km we will hike south from the Sixth Line to Limehouse. The route incorporates the portion of trail removed from the Fifth Line thanks to those who support the Bruce Trail. We'll also pass the seed orchard where native species are grown for the seeds to be replanted to re-naturalize other parts of the trail. Those who want a shorter hike may drop out at Limehouse where information and refreshments will be available at the Memorial Hall. The second part of the hike will be a loop through the Limehouse Conservation area featuring the limestone kilns, stone arched bridge, and a climb through the \"hole in the wall\". Expect some slightly rocky terrain underfoot and a few moderate hills. Hiking boots or good shoes designed for walking are a must. Those completing the full 9 km will also have a chance to drop in at the Memorial Hall to learn more about the Bruce Trail and refreshments.\n\nYou must register and prepay the bus fare on the Bruce Trail Conservancy Website (registration opens Sat Sep 20 8:00 PM (Bus Fares $25 Members/$32 Non-Members (Children under 12 $10/$14). Bus fares are non-refundable and the hike goes rain or shine.\n\nRegistration Link:\n[https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/](https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/)","startDate":"2026-10-04T13:15:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-5-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"York Mills Station","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"Old York Mills Rd, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto Bruce Trail Club","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bruce-trail-club/"},"performer":"Toronto Bruce Trail Club"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"🇯🇵10/4‼️日本人の方専用 FOR JAPANESE : Toronto Japanese English Language Exchange","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-japanese-language-exchange/events/316727712/","description":"#### **This event page is for JAPANESE PEOPLE only.**\n\n**If you are not Japanese, please sign up through a different event page.**\n**こちらのイベントページは日本人の方向けです。**\n\n**Toronto Japanese English Language Exchangeにご興味を持っていただき、ありがとうございます！**\n\n私たちは毎週日曜日の午前9:30から、英語と日本語の練習会を開催しています。\nこの会では、ペアまたは少人数のグループで、50分間の日本語練習と50分間の英語練習を行います。\n使用する教材は、プロの言語教師が作成したものです。\n\n### **お申し込み前にご確認ください**\n\n* **イベントの詳細とミーティン中に使用する教材は、**\n**イベントページのコメント欄にの方のみが見れる設定で共有し、更にMeetupのメッセージ機能を通してご登録されたEmailアドレスへ土曜日ぐらいにお送りしています。**\n* メール受信機能がオフになっていると詳細が届きません。メール受信をオンに、そしてお知らせが届く設定にされることを推奨します。\n* この会は、言語学習を目的とした方向けに開催しています。 それ以外の目的でのご参加はお断りする場合がございます。\n* 安全で安心して参加できる環境を最優先に考えています。\n* 迷惑行為・営業・勧誘行為があった場合、またはオーガナイザーやスタッフの指示に従わない場合は、退会していただくことがあります。\n* 参加費の返金・繰越は不可です。\n\n### **参加費について**\n\n参加費は以下の目的に使用されます。\n・Meetup利用料\n・当日サポートスタッフへの謝礼\n・オーガナイザーEmikoの「よさこい国際化プロジェクト」の活動費\nトロントにはよさこいチームもあり、さまざまなイベントに出演しています。\nご興味のある方は、ぜひご参加ください。\nウェブサイト\n[https://yosakoiambassador.com/](https://yosakoiambassador.com/)\nパフォーマンス動画\n[https://youtu.be/2z8f4p6DJkw](https://youtu.be/2z8f4p6DJkw)\n\n皆さまのご参加をお待ちしております！","startDate":"2026-10-04T13:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fa