hrough the Limehouse Conservation area featuring the limestone kilns, stone arched bridge, and a climb through the \"hole in the wall\". Expect some slightly rocky terrain underfoot and a few moderate hills. Hiking boots or good shoes designed for walking are a must. Those completing the full 9 km will also have a chance to drop in at the Memorial Hall to learn more about the Bruce Trail and refreshments.\n\nYou must register and prepay the bus fare on the Bruce Trail Conservancy Website (registration opens Sat Sep 20 8:00 PM (Bus Fares $25 Members/$32 Non-Members (Children under 12 $10/$14). Bus fares are non-refundable and the hike goes rain or shine.\n\nRegistration Link:\n[https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/](https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/)","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bruce-trail-club/events/316303973/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_APPROVAL","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535868323"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535868323"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:19817500"},"socialProofInsights":{"__typename":"SocialProofInsights","isTrendingEvent":false,"totalInterestedUsers":50,"interestedUsersSample":[{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:310033484"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:321325293"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:323827144"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:38258232"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:255500358"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:255830629"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:185488992"}}]},"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":5,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:231807784"}}},{"__typename":"Rsv